Native app no-claim boundaries:
- Owned-process time-limit proof is scoped to the process started by the proof harness.
- Stale action mismatch rejects before adapter execution.
- Dry-run does not terminate.
- Broad app/package blocking remains manual-required.
- No AppLocker, App Control, install blocking, launch allowlist, or cross-platform enforcement claim is made.
